              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la bufera — \"the blizzard, the storm\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In montagna c'è stata una bufera di neve. In the mountains there was a snowstorm."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Una bufera di vento — a gale."
            }
