          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bufera is built on bufare 'to blow' (EtymDB), a word that imitates a gust of wind; the origin is not settled beyond that."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
